    "closure": "the FFF necessary system is empty away from an exhaustive fourteen-root base-field exceptional set",
    "statement": "For the canonical cell-3 S0 case with sigma_o=-1, epsilon=(-1,-1), xi=2, and pairing=0, the exact q5 quotient has dimension 16 over F_2130706433(t). The column-cleared multiplication determinant of R76=Res_E(q7,q6) is a nonzero polynomial of degree 19060. Every base-field root of that determinant and every denominator introduced by the generic transformations lies in the same explicit fourteen-element set. Hence the original FFF necessary system is empty for every t outside that set, and no other exceptional base-field fiber exists.",
